+# Rollback
+
+To undo the Knowledge boundary extraction:
+
+1. Restore `app/services/knowledge/catalog.rb` to query `Knowledge::Document` directly.
+2. Restore `app/services/knowledge/rebuild_search.rb` to use `Document.where` in its private `documents` method.
+3. Restore `app/services/answering/retrieval_tool.rb` to call `Knowledge::Catalog.list` directly.
+4. Remove `app/services/knowledge/persistence/published_documents.rb` and `app/services/knowledge/delivery/published_documents.rb`.
+
+No database migrations or schema changes were introduced.
